  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nAvatar Touch Haptics have been moved from the Quick Menu Settings to the Main Menu, which is fine, but the place where it has been moved in the Main Menu is \"weird\".\nAvatar Touch Haptics have nothing to do with accessibility, so I don't really get why it's in there. It's the last category I would have assumed it to be in.\n# Suggestion:\nMove the Avatar Touch Haptics from the Accessibility Category to the Comfort & Safety Category. It fit's way better as a Safety / Comfort option than an accessibility setting.",
